<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>重置密码</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="易认证" height="50" />
        <h2>重置密码</h2>
        <p>亲爱的用户: _{{_ .email _}}_</p>
        <p>您于: 【_{{_ .time _}}_】申请重置密码，请点击下面的按钮进入重置密码页面，本次重置密码将于：【_{{_ .expire _}}_】失效</p>
        <a href="_{{_ .link _}}_" style="text-decoration: none; padding: 10px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">重置密码</a>
        <p>如果您没有申请重置密码，请忽略该邮件。</p>
        <a href="_{{_ .server _}}_">易认证</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>